-> A gene is a set of typed particle handlers. Particles are records —
-> the _class tag decides which handler receives them.

PingResponse = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "PingResponse", message ∈ String }

Ping { request_id ∈ String } => {
    emit server.Respond { request_id = request_id, status_code = 200, body = PingResponse { message = "Pong" } } to server
}

HealthCheck { request_id ∈ String } => {
    emit server.Respond { request_id = request_id, status_code = 200, body = PingResponse { message = "ok" } } to server
}
